<text><body><div type="page" n="116"><pb n="116" facs="#f0128"/>
<fw type="header" place="top">II. Das Volk.</fw>
<p xml:id="p116-b1"><lb n="1" facs="#f0128-l1"/>jahr zu Lebensjahr fortgeführte Verhältniß der Sterbefälle liegt kein Material <lb n="2" facs="#f0128-l2"/>vor, wohl aber hat man früher im Bezirke <placeName ref="#place-bezirk-lobenstein-ebersdorf">Lobenstein-Ebersdorf</placeName> einerseits drei <lb n="3" facs="#f0128-l3"/>Altersklassen und zwar die Jugend bis zum 14. Jahre, die Ledigen und die <lb n="4" facs="#f0128-l4"/>Verheiratheten resp. die verwittweten Personen, andererseits zehn Altersklassen <lb n="5" facs="#f0128-l5"/>oder Klassen von zehn zu zehn Jahren nach ihrer Sterblichkeit unterschieden, <lb n="6" facs="#f0128-l6"/>woraus sich einige nicht unwichtige Resultate ableiten lassen.</p>
<table xml:id="p116-b2" facs="#f0128-b2" rows="13" cols="10"><head>G e s t o r b e n e.</head><row role="label"><cell role="label">Jahre.</cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene: Kinder: Knaben.</cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene: Kinder: Mädchen.</cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene: Ledige Personen: männl.</cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene: Ledige Personen: weibl.</cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene: Verheirathete: männl.</cell><cell role="label">Gestorbene: Verheirathete: weibl.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten der Gestorbenen: Kinder.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten der Gestorbenen: Ledige.</cell><cell role="label">In Procenten der Gestorbenen: Verh.</cell></row><row><cell>1794</cell><cell>97</cell><cell>65</cell><cell>8</cell><cell>22</cell><cell>70</cell><cell>80</cell><cell>47,37</cell><cell>8,77</cell><cell>43,86</cell></row><row><cell>1795</cell><cell>106</cell><cell>80</cell><cell>12</cell><cell>17</cell><cell>104</cell><cell>121</cell><cell>42,27</cell><cell>6,49</cell><cell>51,14</cell></row><row><cell>1796</cell><cell>119</cell><cell>118</cell><cell>25</cell><cell>30</cell><cell>92</cell><cell>92</cell><cell>49,79</cell><cell>11,55</cell><cell>38,66</cell></row><row><cell>1797</cell><cell>157</cell><cell>104</cell><cell>14</cell><cell>27</cell><cell>113</cell><cell>123</cell><cell>48,51</cell><cell>7,62</cell><cell>43,87</cell></row><row><cell>1798</cell><cell>151</cell><cell>84</cell><cell>15</cell><cell>23</cell><cell>85</cell><cell>111</cell><cell>50,11</cell><cell>8,10</cell><cell>41,79</cell></row><row><cell>1799</cell><cell>102</cell><cell>102</cell><cell>15</cell><cell>18</cell><cell>73</cell><cell>95</cell><cell>50,37</cell><cell>8,15</cell><cell>41,48</cell></row><row><cell>1800</cell><cell>322</cell><cell>287</cell><cell>29</cell><cell>40</cell><cell>146</cell><cell>156</cell><cell>62,14</cell><cell>7,04</cell><cell>30,82</cell></row><row><cell>1801</cell><cell>117</cell><cell>91</cell><cell>22</cell><cell>24</cell><cell>100</cell><cell>108</cell><cell>45,02</cell><cell>9,96</cell><cell>45,02</cell></row><row><cell>1802</cell><cell>146</cell><cell>110</cell><cell>20</cell><cell>28</cell><cell>72</cell><cell>116</cell><cell>52,03</cell><cell>9,76</cell><cell>38,21</cell></row><row><cell>1803</cell><cell>114</cell><cell>99</cell><cell>16</cell><cell>13</cell><cell>93</cell><cell>91</cell><cell>50,00</cell><cell>6,80</cell><cell>43,20</cell></row><row><cell>1804</cell><cell>95</cell><cell>78</cell><cell>13</cell><cell>9</cell><cell>83</cell><cell>87</cell><cell>47,39</cell><cell>6,03</cell><cell>46,58</cell></row><row><cell>Durchschnitt 1794-1804</cell><cell>138,72</cell><cell>110,72</cell><cell>17,18</cell><cell>22,82</cell><cell>93,72</cell><cell>107,27</cell><cell>49,55</cell><cell>8,21</cell><cell>42,24</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p116-b3">Im <lb n="11" facs="#f0128-l11"/>Durchschnitte war somit früher in diesem oberländischen Bezirke die <lb n="12" facs="#f0128-l12"/>Zahl der Gestorbenen auf Seiten der Jugend (bis zum 14. Lebensjahre) <lb n="13" facs="#f0128-l13"/>größer als die der Erwachsenen. Nach zehnjährigen Altersklassen vertheilen sich <lb n="14" facs="#f0128-l14"/>in derselben Zeit die Gestorbenen also:</p>
<table xml:id="p116-b4" facs="#f0128-b4" rows="13" cols="11"><head>L e b e n s a l t e r. 247,15</head><row><cell>Jahre.</cell><cell>0-10</cell><cell>10-20</cell><cell>20-30</cell><cell>30-40</cell><cell>40-50</cell><cell>50-60</cell><cell>60-70</cell><cell>70-80</cell><cell>80-90</cell><cell>90-100</cell></row><row><cell>1794</cell><cell>161</cell><cell>10</cell><cell>8</cell><cell>16</cell><cell>23</cell><cell>33</cell><cell>43</cell><cell>43</cell><cell>5</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>1795</cell><cell>180</cell><cell>14</cell><cell>16</cell><cell>23</cell><cell>25</cell><cell>55</cell><cell>62</cell><cell>46</cell><cell>18</cell><cell>1</cell></row><row><cell>1796</cell><cell>234</cell><cell>15</cell><cell>23</cell><cell>19</cell><cell>28</cell><cell>37</cell><cell>56</cell><cell>46</cell><cell>17</cell><cell>1</cell></row><row><cell>1797</cell><cell>245</cell><cell>25</cell><cell>15</cell><cell>32</cell><cell>41</cell><cell>43</cell><cell>68</cell><cell>52</cell><cell>17</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>1798</cell><cell>222</cell><cell>30</cell><cell>21</cell><cell>22</cell><cell>20</cell><cell>48</cell><cell>56</cell><cell>38</cell><cell>11</cell><cell>1</cell></row><row><cell>1799</cell><cell>203</cell><cell>13</cell><cell>9</cell><cell>21</cell><cell>20</cell><cell>31</cell><cell>52</cell><cell>45</cell><cell>10</cell><cell>1</cell></row><row><cell>1800</cell><cell>585</cell><cell>41</cell><cell>35</cell><cell>23</cell><cell>50</cell><cell>71</cell><cell>90</cell><cell>75</cell><cell>10</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>1801</cell><cell>205</cell><cell>18</cell><cell>18</cell><cell>22</cell><cell>31</cell><cell>47</cell><cell>62</cell><cell>51</cell><cell>8</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>1802</cell><cell>252</cell><cell>9</cell><cell>24</cell><cell>24</cell><cell>23</cell><cell>39</cell><cell>63</cell><cell>40</cell><cell>10</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>1803</cell><cell>212</cell><cell>8</cell><cell>12</cell><cell>23</cell><cell>36</cell><cell>28</cell><cell>49</cell><cell>47</cell><cell>13</cell><cell>1</cell></row><row><cell>1804</cell><cell>172</cell><cell>5</cell><cell>9</cell><cell>22</cell><cell>24</cell><cell>33</cell><cell>54</cell><cell>38</cell><cell>8</cell><cell>—</cell></row><row><cell>Durchschnitt 1794-1804</cell><cell>242,82</cell><cell>17,09</cell><cell>17,27</cell><cell>22,45</cell><cell>29,18</cell><cell>42,27</cell><cell>59,54</cell><cell>47,36</cell><cell>11,54</cell><cell>0,45</cell></row></table>
<p xml:id="p116-b5"><lb n="19" facs="#f0128-l19"/>Die Zahl der Gestorbenen im ersten Jahrzehnt war demnach nicht viel <lb n="20" facs="#f0128-l20"/>kleiner als die Zahl der Gestorbenen in den übrigen Jahrzehnten. Ein Lebens<lb n="21" break="no" facs="#f0128-l21"/>alter über 100 Jahre kam in dieser Periode nicht vor.</p>
